    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers are delighted to present this superbly upgraded 2-bedroom mid-terrace property to the market at 545 Carnlough Avenue, a charming and highly sought-after residential address.\n\nThis fine home comes to the market in turn-key condition throughout and has been extensively refurbished in recent years to include full re-wiring, new plumbing, upgraded insulation, and a brand-new boiler, offering excellent energy efficiency and peace of mind for the new owner. The property further benefits from a brand-new contemporary kitchen with quality fitted units, integrated appliances and a central island unit, creating a fantastic open and sociable living space.\n\nInternally, living accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and stylish front living room with feature fireplace, a modern open-plan kitchen/dining area overlooking the rear garden, two generously sized double bedrooms, and a sleek fully tiled shower room finished to a high standard.\n\nExternally, the property boasts a generous rear garden laid in lawn, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining or future extension potential (subject to planning permission). To the front, there is ample on-street parking.\n\nThe property is further enhanced by double glazed windows and gas-fired central heating. With a C2 BER rating, this home offers strong energy performance rarely found in properties of this type and age. Carnlough Avenue is a mature and popular residential location, conveniently positioned close to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, parks and leisure facilities. The area is extremely well serviced by public transport, with regular bus routes nearby and excellent road links providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nWith an asking price of 425,000, this outstanding home represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. Early viewing is highly advised - this is one not to be missed. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• Superb 2-bedroom mid-terrace residence\n• c. 60 sq.m\n• Turn-key condition throughout\n• Extensively refurbished in recent years\n• Full re-wiring, new plumbing and upgraded insulation\n• Brand-new gas boiler\n• Contemporary fitted kitchen with central island\n• Open-plan kitchen / dining area\n• Bright living room with feature fireplace\n• Two double bedrooms\n• Fully tiled modern shower room\n• Double glazed windows\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• BER C2\n• Generous rear garden\n• Future extension potential (subject to planning permission)\n• Ample on-street parking\n• Mature and highly sought-after residential location\n• Close to amenities and public transport\n• LUAS within walking distance\n• Easy access to Dublin City Centre\n"
      },
      {
